WEBVTT

00:06.577 --> 00:07.777
<i>Rabbit...</i>

00:08.137 --> 00:10.167
<i>Why'd you have to get yourself arrested?</i>

00:10.697 --> 00:13.657
<i>You were saying all that great stuff...</i>

00:14.397 --> 00:18.627
<i>But I am more confident now that 
I've actually made a great item.</i>

00:23.417 --> 00:25.127
Work

00:25.507 --> 00:28.977
<i>Instead of doing day labor, 
wouldn't it be better</i>

00:28.977 --> 00:31.697
<i>to make money with something I'm good at?</i>

00:33.557 --> 00:34.387
What?

00:34.387 --> 00:36.647
You're not going to your day job anymore?

00:36.647 --> 00:40.657
Yeah. I think I should take advantage 
of the things I'm good at.

00:40.657 --> 00:42.807
What are you thinking, Brother?

00:42.807 --> 00:45.027
Are you going back to being a NEET?

00:45.027 --> 00:47.957
No! I'm going to make money in the game.

00:47.957 --> 00:49.987
You're still saying that?

00:49.987 --> 00:51.907
You just want to play games all day.

00:51.907 --> 00:53.497
That's not true!

00:53.497 --> 00:56.107
I can sell the items I make in the game!

00:56.107 --> 00:58.957
I can make hundreds of 
thousands of yen a month!

00:59.757 --> 01:02.977
Takumi, you need to wake up.

01:03.517 --> 01:09.027
If you could really make money in 
a game, you wouldn't be in debt.

01:09.027 --> 01:11.637
Th-That's true...

01:11.637 --> 01:14.697
But I just changed jobs to being 
a legendary blacksmith...

01:14.697 --> 01:16.337
Stop this nonsense.

01:17.187 --> 01:21.247
Takumi, it's not easy to make money.

01:21.247 --> 01:24.237
You just have to work hard 
and save up little by little.

01:24.237 --> 01:27.657
Your mom and I work hard every day.

01:28.067 --> 01:32.087
You're an adult now. 
Keep working like you have been.

01:32.417 --> 01:33.317
Understand?

01:56.247 --> 01:57.777
<b>Overgeared</b>

01:57.777 --> 02:01.007
<b>Overgeared</b>

03:17.027 --> 03:21.697
I've been doing blacksmithing after 
my day job for a whole month.

03:21.697 --> 03:24.127
This is rough!

03:24.557 --> 03:27.537
I really should quit that job...

03:28.417 --> 03:31.197
I need to get my family to agree somehow.

03:32.757 --> 03:36.257
Damn it! If only Rabbit 
hadn't been arrested!

03:36.627 --> 03:37.737
<i>Grid-san.</i>

03:38.397 --> 03:41.747
<i>I believe you're aware 
of my current situation.</i>

03:41.747 --> 03:46.377
<i>I'm truly sorry our business 
plan didn't work out.</i>

03:46.377 --> 03:53.847
<i>But with your skill and Khan-san's 
help, I'm sure you can become rich.</i>

03:54.337 --> 03:58.887
<i>I'm looking forward to hearing 
stories of your success someday.</i>

03:59.457 --> 04:00.807
<i>Rabbit.</i>

04:03.787 --> 04:05.807
My luck sucks.

04:06.057 --> 04:09.777
And what's Huroi up to?

04:10.287 --> 04:14.947
And there's no sign of that little 
brat that pisses me off, either.

04:16.527 --> 04:21.617
<b>Frontier</b>

04:17.957 --> 04:23.377
I came all the way to the capital, and 
I can't find a crafting recipe for an orb.

04:48.987 --> 04:52.187
Hey. Are you guys perverts?

04:52.677 --> 04:56.167
You're a little old to be 
following a girl around all day.

04:57.217 --> 04:59.937
<i>She saw through my camouflage skill?</i>

05:00.817 --> 05:03.667
You're the blacksmith 
who made an epic item

05:03.667 --> 05:06.287
during the item creation match 
in Winston Village, right?

05:06.677 --> 05:08.497
I want to talk to you.

05:13.777 --> 05:16.857
Is that how you ask for 
something from someone?

05:16.857 --> 05:18.657
Talk, kid.

05:19.257 --> 05:21.307
Did you just call me a kid?

05:24.807 --> 05:26.267
Angel Scream!

05:34.117 --> 05:36.777
You still want to talk?

05:39.107 --> 05:42.327
Just who <i>are</i> you?

05:48.237 --> 05:50.197
Th-This is...

05:51.847 --> 05:52.877
Faker!

05:53.727 --> 05:55.947
Sorry... I screwed up.

05:57.197 --> 05:59.257
She was alone?!

05:59.257 --> 06:00.617
Ridiculous!

06:00.617 --> 06:03.127
You're the number one ranked assassin!

06:03.127 --> 06:05.427
How could you get found by a blacksmith?

06:05.427 --> 06:10.217
She was able to use all types of skills.

06:10.217 --> 06:11.437
What?

06:11.907 --> 06:14.977
She's not the blacksmith I'm looking for?

06:15.457 --> 06:16.337
But...

06:16.957 --> 06:18.857
Find her fast.

06:19.317 --> 06:24.367
We'll teach her not to mess
with the Tzedakah Guild!

06:28.327 --> 06:31.447
Grid, why don't you get some rest?

06:31.447 --> 06:36.627
Yeah. I've been swinging this 
hammer for a solid month.

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b>Job Abilities</b>

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Skill

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Appraisal

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Disassembly

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Repair

06:37.147 --> 06:41.587
<b>Skills</b>

06:37.147 --> 06:37.337
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.147 --> 06:37.257
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.257 --> 06:37.337
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.337 --> 06:37.417
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.337 --> 06:37.417
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.417 --> 06:37.507
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.417 --> 06:37.507
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.457 --> 06:41.587
<i>My level is still low, but my 
blacksmithing skills have improved.</i>

06:37.507 --> 06:37.587
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.507 --> 06:37.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.587 --> 06:37.667
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.587 --> 06:37.667
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.667 --> 06:37.757
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.667 --> 06:37.757
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:37.757 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Breath of the Legendary Blacksmith

06:37.757 --> 06:41.587
<b></b>Legendary Blacksmith Creation

06:41.937 --> 06:44.847
<i>And the items I've made 
have started to sell.</i>

06:44.847 --> 06:46.697
<i>People seem to like them, too.</i>

06:47.217 --> 06:52.477
<i>The problem is that most of the 
items I've crafted are normal.</i>

06:52.477 --> 06:55.227
<i>I've only made three epic ones.</i>

06:55.227 --> 06:58.727
How am <i>I</i> the legendary blacksmith?!

06:58.727 --> 07:01.817
Damn you, GMs! Your damn game's broke!

07:01.817 --> 07:04.657
I'm calling consumer protection!

07:05.917 --> 07:08.577
Chief, look at this.

07:08.837 --> 07:10.707
What? An angry user?

07:10.707 --> 07:15.267
The probability of a better 
item goes up as you level up.

07:13.787 --> 07:18.797
<b>From\h\h\h\h\h\h\hGrid</b>

07:13.787 --> 07:18.797
m 0 0 l 365 0 365 70 0 70

07:13.787 --> 07:18.797
<b>I'm the legendary blacksmith,
so why the hell can't I make any legendary items?
I've made 73 items this past month and only 3
were epic!

Not a single one is unique or legendary!
You guys are messing with the item crafting
rates, aren't you?

I know where you live!</b>

07:15.267 --> 07:17.537
Why is he saying this stuff?

07:17.537 --> 07:21.547
Obviously, he doesn't understand
something so simple.

07:23.447 --> 07:27.507
But if he's only made three epic items 
despite having legendary skills,

07:27.507 --> 07:30.427
I can't blame him for 
thinking we're cheating.

07:30.427 --> 07:33.677
Sure, but I don't see any errors.

07:33.677 --> 07:35.557
And we haven't modified the probabilities.

07:35.917 --> 07:36.767
That means...

07:37.517 --> 07:39.547
his luck just sucks.

07:40.277 --> 07:44.777
<i>So... how much would the items 
I've made so far sell for?</i>

07:44.777 --> 07:50.787
<i>If I just take how much I've earned after 
materials costs... 129,480 yen, huh?</i>

07:53.047 --> 07:56.437
<i>I can make that much in a month 
just working at night?</i>

07:56.437 --> 07:59.487
<i>If I did it all day, I'd make even more.</i>

08:00.177 --> 08:03.837
How come Mom and Dad don't understand?!

08:05.757 --> 08:08.887
The Ultimate Capsule Café

08:06.637 --> 08:08.887
<b>Customers who register on 9/10</b>

08:06.887 --> 08:08.887
<b>Lifetime 30% Off Capsule Use</b>

08:10.637 --> 08:12.657
<i>Th-That's so cheap!</i>

08:12.657 --> 08:15.897
<i>I can pretend I'm at work 
and play the game all day!</i>

08:18.017 --> 08:19.017
<b>Race forward!!</b>

08:18.017 --> 08:19.017
<b>A shining tomorrow</b>

08:18.017 --> 08:19.017
<b>Dreams</b>

08:23.297 --> 08:27.067
<i>Starting today, this is my new office!</i>

08:23.397 --> 08:25.527
<b>Capsule Café</b>

08:30.197 --> 08:31.867
Amazing!

08:31.867 --> 08:35.327
Its stats are 20% better than 
other items of the same level!

08:35.327 --> 08:37.167
Don't you have more?

08:37.707 --> 08:40.237
This is all we've got.

08:40.237 --> 08:43.667
We use good materials and 
take our time, you see.

08:47.757 --> 08:52.307
<i>I'm logged in fifteen hours a day total, 
including my time at the capsule café.</i>

08:52.727 --> 08:55.767
<i>I spent twenty hours making this!
It's my best yet!</i>

08:56.167 --> 09:00.007
<i>I hope it's legendary... 
or at least unique...</i>

09:00.007 --> 09:00.977
<i>Please!</i>

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b>Very Delicate Plate Armor</b>

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>Class: Epic

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>m 0 0 l 48 0 48 5 0 5

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>Defense

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>Move Speed

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>*Very low chance of negating damage from pierce attacks

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>m 0 0 l 148 0 148 5 0 5

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>m 0 0 l 48 0 48 6 0 6

09:05.587 --> 09:07.067
<b></b>m 0 0 l 30 0 30 6 0 6

09:11.587 --> 09:14.747
What's wrong? It's wonderful!

09:15.037 --> 09:17.287
But it's only an epic.

09:17.287 --> 09:19.627
How much do you think it'll sell for?

09:20.187 --> 09:22.027
Hard to say.

09:22.027 --> 09:24.667
But maybe you could put it 
up for auction at the castle.

09:24.947 --> 09:26.627
Auction, huh?

09:26.627 --> 09:28.517
Yeah. If they know I sent you,

09:28.517 --> 09:31.047
they'll probably let 
you skip the paperwork.

09:31.337 --> 09:35.307
Temper your expectations and
it'll be a good experience for you.

09:36.047 --> 09:38.807
<i>You obtained "Proof of Khan's Successor."</i>

09:39.247 --> 09:41.317
I won't get my hopes up.

09:41.897 --> 09:44.687
I know how bad my luck is.

09:54.267 --> 09:57.027
<i>I'll be putting up my plate armor</i>

09:57.027 --> 10:00.877
<i>and this epic gauntlet I just 
managed to finish in time.</i>

10:01.297 --> 10:03.407
<i>The question is what the 
starting bid should be.</i>

10:03.407 --> 10:05.297
<i>If it's too high, it won't sell.</i>

10:05.787 --> 10:06.907
Hello!

10:07.897 --> 10:09.677
My name is Steng.

10:09.677 --> 10:11.817
I'm here on an errand for my master,

10:11.817 --> 10:15.097
but if there's something you 
don't understand, I can help you.

10:15.097 --> 10:16.927
<i>Who's this? Another player?</i>

10:17.607 --> 10:21.987
What's the normal starting bid 
for an item around level 120?

10:22.417 --> 10:25.967
For a normal one, I'd say around 300 gold?

10:25.967 --> 10:27.337
And if it's epic?

10:27.337 --> 10:29.457
E-Epic?!

10:29.457 --> 10:33.737
A glove would be 600, 
and armor would be over 1,800 gold!

10:33.977 --> 10:36.187
<i>That's around 2,400 gold total!</i>

10:36.187 --> 10:37.867
<i>Around 290,000 yen?!</i>

10:38.257 --> 10:40.877
<i>If I can sell it for that much...</i>

10:40.877 --> 10:42.997
<i>I'll be rich!</i>

10:45.607 --> 10:46.627
What?

10:46.627 --> 10:48.317
Nothing...

10:53.057 --> 10:55.927
Grid-san, the bidding's over.

10:56.227 --> 10:57.997
The results are about to be announced.

11:00.337 --> 11:02.187
Your attention, please.

11:02.477 --> 11:05.937
Only six items were sold today.

11:07.057 --> 11:08.817
Just six?

11:09.037 --> 11:12.927
Claris-san's necklace sold for 453 gold.

11:12.927 --> 11:16.687
Grace-san's armor padding 
sold for 189 gold.

11:17.097 --> 11:21.077
Figret-san's healing items 
sold for 15 gold apiece.

11:21.297 --> 11:25.337
And Steng-san's longsword 
sold for 1,900 gold.

11:25.337 --> 11:26.887
H-Hooray!

11:26.887 --> 11:29.037
My master will be so pleased!

11:29.037 --> 11:30.587
Don't you think so?

11:30.587 --> 11:34.257
How the hell would I know 
what your master thinks?

11:34.777 --> 11:36.597
G-Good point.

11:36.597 --> 11:38.037
Lastly...

11:38.037 --> 11:39.977
Is Grid-san here?

11:40.887 --> 11:42.437
That's me.

11:42.787 --> 11:45.087
The administrator wishes to speak to you.

11:45.397 --> 11:46.817
Follow me to a private room.

11:47.057 --> 11:48.937
I'm sure it's good news!

11:48.937 --> 11:52.067
They recognized your hard work!

11:52.497 --> 11:54.597
Y-You think so?

11:58.227 --> 12:01.537
I've heard about you.

12:01.807 --> 12:04.077
Khan's been a good teacher, it seems.

12:04.077 --> 12:07.337
<i>Actually, it's mostly my own skill.</i>

12:07.337 --> 12:09.637
I'll make this quick.

12:09.637 --> 12:14.587
I'll buy the gauntlet and 
armor you made for 5,500 gold.

12:16.467 --> 12:20.057
<i>5,500 gold... That's...</i>

12:20.827 --> 12:22.857
<i>660,000 yen!</i>

12:23.227 --> 12:27.367
And I won't stop at armor.
I want weapons, too.

12:27.367 --> 12:29.927
Three swords, within a week.

12:29.927 --> 12:32.987
Epic, at a minimum.

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b></b>Quest

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b>Deal with the Administrator</b>

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b></b>Craft the equipment that Administrator Valdi is asking for!

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b>m 0 0 l 305 0 305 35 0 35</b>

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b></b>Clear Condition: Craft and turn in three epic class swords
between level 120 and 180 within a week.

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b></b>Clear Reward: Changes depending on item quality.

12:33.127 --> 12:39.737
<b></b>Failure: The deal will be canceled and further quests will disappear.

12:33.537 --> 12:34.967
<i>A quest has been generated.</i>

12:33.777 --> 12:34.957
<i>Hey, now...</i>

12:34.957 --> 12:37.137
<i>I almost never get anything but normal!</i>

12:37.137 --> 12:39.737
<i>Of course I'm going to turn it down!</i>

12:39.737 --> 12:43.747
Of course, I'll pay you more 
than what you got for these items.

12:48.257 --> 12:48.897
<i>I...</i>

12:50.237 --> 12:51.317
<i>I accepted it.</i>

12:51.937 --> 12:56.687
<i>Can I really make three 
epic items in a week?!</i>

13:01.517 --> 13:03.637
I'm sure it's good news!

13:03.637 --> 13:06.557
They recognized your hard work!

13:07.367 --> 13:10.007
He was as happy as if they'd 
asked to speak with him...

13:11.357 --> 13:12.997
I guess I have to do it.

13:14.957 --> 13:17.907
I won't give up before I start.

13:22.407 --> 13:24.657
<b><b>Sturdy Longsword</b></b>

13:22.407 --> 13:24.657
<b>Class: Normal</b>

13:22.407 --> 13:24.657
<b>Attack</b>

13:29.197 --> 13:31.037
That's a wonderful sword.

13:31.037 --> 13:33.137
Huh?! It's normal!

13:33.137 --> 13:34.757
Normal!

13:35.247 --> 13:37.717
What are you so mad about?

13:37.717 --> 13:40.477
I've only got the materials 
to make seven swords,

13:40.477 --> 13:43.967
and I've already failed at the first!

13:45.557 --> 13:48.347
Effort will never betray you.

13:48.347 --> 13:50.857
Believe in yourself and try your best.

13:51.427 --> 13:52.837
Old man Khan...

13:58.257 --> 14:01.297
E-Effort will never betray you...

14:00.277 --> 14:02.177
Shut up! Not another word!

14:02.617 --> 14:05.497
Epic! Unique! Legendary!

14:05.617 --> 14:08.327
Epic! Unique! Legendary!

14:09.617 --> 14:13.797
Epic! Unique! Legendary!
Epic! Unique! Legendary!

14:15.167 --> 14:18.167
Epic! Unique! Legendary!
Epic! Unique! Legendary!

14:18.457 --> 14:23.177
Epic! Unique! Legendary!
Epic! Unique! Legendary!

14:23.747 --> 14:28.937
Three normals, a rare, and two epics, huh?

14:30.127 --> 14:31.987
This is the last one...

14:32.757 --> 14:35.217
Grid, are you okay?

14:36.017 --> 14:38.537
Of course. I'm fine.

14:38.897 --> 14:41.197
I've given up.

14:41.197 --> 14:44.697
Don't be such a wimp. 
You're Pagma's Successor!

14:46.467 --> 14:49.707
I'm not Pagma's Successor. 
I'm Normal's Successor.

14:52.177 --> 14:54.257
<i>My heart is already empty.</i>

14:55.937 --> 14:57.287
<i>I shall wish for no more.</i>

15:00.717 --> 15:02.217
Th-This is...

15:09.327 --> 15:11.797
Wh-What's this effect?

15:12.997 --> 15:16.777
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 42 0 42</b>

15:12.997 --> 15:16.777
<b><b>Sword of Self-Transcendence
</b>Class: Legendary

Attack: 356
Attack Speed: +6%
Accuracy: +10%
Defense: +10%
*Does target level + 200 additional damage
when attacking
*Generates skill "Transcend"</b>

15:17.017 --> 15:22.777
<i>Crafting a legendary item has added a 
permanent +25 boost to all your stats.</i>

15:23.187 --> 15:26.117
<i>Your fame will increase by 1,000 
across the entire continent.</i>

15:26.117 --> 15:30.037
<i>You have earned the title 
"The Only Legendary Crafter."</i>

15:35.617 --> 15:37.267
Khan!

15:42.367 --> 15:44.417
Th-The Blood Witch...

15:44.947 --> 15:46.307
She's unstoppable...

15:48.277 --> 15:54.097
I'm sorry I can't avenge 
you, Doran-sama...

15:57.977 --> 16:02.197
We must rip apart his corpse 
and offer it to Yatan.

16:02.737 --> 16:07.447
<i>To be honest, I don't like these 
awful Yatan Church guys at all.</i>

16:07.917 --> 16:10.947
<i>But if I can't get a class 
change book like Roy,</i>

16:10.947 --> 16:13.957
<i>someday I won't be able to keep up 
with the higher-ranked classes.</i>

16:13.957 --> 16:19.707
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 50 0 50</b>

16:13.957 --> 16:19.707
<b></b>Quest
<b>The Eighth Servant (SS)</b>

Save the Yatan cultists who are
 trapped in their temple by Earl Steim's army.
Become the Eighth Servant of Yatan.

Clear Reward: Rank "The Eighth Servant"
*Eighth Servant: Skill "Infinite Faith"
Skill: "Speak the Teachings"
Skill: "Divine Punishment"

Failure: Level -5, Faith -1,000

16:14.757 --> 16:19.707
<i>I need to clear this SS-ranked quest 
and get myself some powerful skills.</i>

16:20.257 --> 16:23.227
<i>I'll overcome the limits 
of a Black Mage...</i>

16:23.967 --> 16:25.877
<i>so I can be the top-ranked player!</i>

16:27.597 --> 16:29.707
The force we sent was wiped out?

16:29.707 --> 16:33.477
Just like our intel said, 
the cultists were few in number.

16:33.727 --> 16:36.227
But the Blood Witch was there.

16:38.757 --> 16:40.457
We can't give up!

16:40.887 --> 16:43.027
Hurry and strengthen our 
units' equipment, please!

16:44.397 --> 16:47.667
<i>Doran, I'll avenge you!</i>

16:48.267 --> 16:50.077
I knew it! Money!

16:50.557 --> 16:52.737
I got one gold!

16:52.737 --> 16:54.917
I actually found some money!

16:54.917 --> 16:57.077
Is luck on my side now?

16:57.077 --> 16:59.387
Welcome to my wallet, little coin!

17:00.797 --> 17:05.647
Irene-sama, I've actually 
asked Grid to make us items.

17:05.647 --> 17:09.587
He was the one who revealed the 
Mero Company's evil deeds before.

17:09.587 --> 17:12.807
Oh, my! So you're the blacksmith 
everyone's talking about!

17:13.457 --> 17:18.327
I was thinking of rewarding you 
sooner, but I've been busy...

17:18.327 --> 17:22.897
Irene-sama, this is the 
greatsword he gave us.

17:22.897 --> 17:24.337
A-Amazing!

17:24.337 --> 17:25.647
What an incredible sword!

17:27.077 --> 17:27.897
So?

17:31.047 --> 17:33.367
How much will you pay for it?

17:33.367 --> 17:37.387
You'll pay me what this 
legendary item is worth, right?

17:37.387 --> 17:38.677
Sir Phoenix...

17:38.677 --> 17:42.127
Can we defeat that witch with this sword?

17:42.867 --> 17:45.127
She'll have no chance.

17:46.127 --> 17:48.387
Then there's no need to hesitate.

17:48.757 --> 17:51.167
I'll let the administrator 
determine the price.

17:52.287 --> 17:54.347
Grid, was it?

17:54.727 --> 17:57.787
I hope we can continue to do business.

18:00.337 --> 18:03.057
<i>I think I've seen that ring somewhere...</i>

18:04.097 --> 18:05.177
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

18:06.257 --> 18:09.617
<i>For now, I just like that 
she's willing to spend cash.</i>

18:10.617 --> 18:13.347
We'll pay 220,000 gold for it.

18:13.347 --> 18:16.407
What?! It's worth a lot more than...

18:16.947 --> 18:18.327
Huh? Thousand?

18:20.567 --> 18:23.047
<i>220,000 gold?!</i>

18:23.047 --> 18:26.087
<i>That's 26.4 million yen!</i>

18:26.707 --> 18:31.427
<i>I can buy a luxury car and go to the 
class reunions I've been skipping!</i>

18:31.427 --> 18:34.967
<i>I know! I can confess 
to my first love, Arisa!</i>

18:35.217 --> 18:39.387
<i>All my suffering was for today...</i>

18:41.177 --> 18:43.107
I'll take the deal!

18:43.107 --> 18:45.107
Good. We appreciate it.

18:45.107 --> 18:48.317
This is a small gift from us.

18:48.317 --> 18:49.927
Blue Orichalcum.

18:49.927 --> 18:51.867
I'm sure it will be useful to you.

18:52.087 --> 18:55.697
<i>That's the material for the thing 
I tried to make and failed!</i>

18:55.697 --> 18:59.577
<i>I'm not at the point where I can 
make it yet, but lucky me!</i>

18:59.917 --> 19:01.247
Thank you!

19:01.247 --> 19:04.247
This concludes our deal.

19:05.387 --> 19:06.837
<i>Quest clear.</i>

19:06.837 --> 19:13.047
<b></b>Quest Clear!
You got the clear reward!

19:06.837 --> 19:09.987
<i>You also earned a ranking 
as an additional bonus.</i>

19:08.757 --> 19:13.047
<b></b>Ranking: <b>Nobleman of Winston</b>

19:09.987 --> 19:13.047
<i>You are no longer required 
to pay taxes in Winston.</i>

19:13.047 --> 19:15.977
<i>I feel so good...</i>

19:15.977 --> 19:18.147
<i>I can't wait to tell Mom and Dad!</i>

19:19.017 --> 19:21.267
<b>Grid</b>

19:19.017 --> 19:21.267
<b>Job</b>

19:19.017 --> 19:21.267
<b>Pagma's Successor</b>

19:19.017 --> 19:21.267
<b>Title</b>

19:19.017 --> 19:21.267
<b>Legendary One</b>

19:21.267 --> 19:25.017
Grid thinks he made a lot of money, but...

19:25.017 --> 19:27.777
He actually lost a lot.

19:28.017 --> 19:29.737
In a few months,

19:29.737 --> 19:33.877
a lot of users will be able to use 
something like the Sword of Transcendence.

19:33.877 --> 19:35.907
Then it would be more expensive.

19:36.357 --> 19:40.657
That sword would be worth 
several hundred million yen.

19:40.657 --> 19:44.917
<b>Grid</b>

19:40.657 --> 19:44.917
<b>Job</b>

19:40.657 --> 19:44.917
<b>Pagma's Successor</b>

19:40.657 --> 19:44.917
<b>Title</b>

19:40.657 --> 19:44.917
<b>Legendary One</b>

19:41.127 --> 19:43.197
He has bad luck, then.

19:44.917 --> 19:47.667
Nagamine Greengrocers

19:49.807 --> 19:51.327
I'm back!

19:51.327 --> 19:53.727
Listen, everyone! I've finally...

19:53.727 --> 19:55.927
Did something happen?

19:56.507 --> 19:57.677
Brother...

19:58.337 --> 20:02.567
Dad was guarantor for someone he knew...

20:03.937 --> 20:07.117
and now he has to pay their debt.

20:07.527 --> 20:08.817
Eighty million yen.

20:11.567 --> 20:17.827
If we sell the house and empty our 
savings, that's forty million yen.

20:18.227 --> 20:22.017
I saved up that money for Seira's college,

20:22.017 --> 20:23.957
coming-of-age ceremony, and wedding...

20:23.957 --> 20:25.807
I'm so sorry!

20:25.807 --> 20:29.307
Dad, I don't have to go to college.

20:28.597 --> 20:31.297
I'm your kid, too, you know...

20:29.307 --> 20:31.297
I'll find a job and help pay you back!

20:31.647 --> 20:34.847
Seira! We're sorry we 
couldn't be better parents!

20:34.847 --> 20:37.287
It's okay! I'm fine!

20:37.287 --> 20:40.307
I'm so sorry, Seira!

20:40.307 --> 20:44.847
<i>Huh? They've totally forgotten about me...</i>

20:49.687 --> 20:52.817
Fine! I'll earn that 
eighty million yen for you!

20:54.567 --> 20:58.017
I'll find a new job tomorrow!

20:54.567 --> 20:57.697
I'll start working part-time tomorrow!

20:54.567 --> 20:57.697
I'll start working on weekends!

20:58.017 --> 21:00.657
I made a ton of money in the game!

21:00.657 --> 21:02.627
More than twenty million yen!

21:05.167 --> 21:06.337
What did you say?

21:09.037 --> 21:11.787
Th-There's really twenty 
million yen in here!

21:11.787 --> 21:13.007
You didn't...

21:13.007 --> 21:15.757
Brother, you didn't 
break the law, did you?!

21:15.757 --> 21:19.047
I earned it in the game. Relax.

21:23.237 --> 21:27.057
I'm sorry I didn't listen 
to what you had to say.

21:27.297 --> 21:28.807
Dad...

21:28.807 --> 21:31.557
You really worked hard 
in the game, didn't you?

21:31.917 --> 21:34.277
That's amazing, Takumi.

21:34.277 --> 21:36.377
But are you sure?

21:36.697 --> 21:38.427
Yeah. Go ahead and use it.

21:38.787 --> 21:40.077
Thank you.

21:40.077 --> 21:42.587
I think we can repay this now.

21:43.077 --> 21:48.287
I'll repay the rest of the debt and 
your 24 million yen in three years.

21:48.627 --> 21:51.347
We're family. Don't worry about it.

21:51.347 --> 21:56.217
Also, it's not 24 million.
It's 24,800,000 yen.

21:56.217 --> 21:57.637
Y-Yeah...

21:57.637 --> 21:59.447
<i>They finally respect me!</i>

21:59.447 --> 22:02.097
I'll work hard, too, honey!

22:02.097 --> 22:03.367
I'll help, too!

22:03.367 --> 22:05.547
<i>He still owes a lot of money.</i>

22:04.377 --> 22:06.257
Yeah, let's all work together!

22:05.827 --> 22:08.727
<i>But this time, I have to help my family!</i>
